hostapd: relay 802.11v WNM (BTM) action frames to the CAP

A BSS Transition Management Response from a station is a WNM action
frame (category 10).  The manager sends its BTM Request through the
0x2019 action path; the station's response needs the same ext-auth
relay as a Radio Measurement report so the manager sees the result.

--- a/src/ap/ieee802_11.c
+++ b/src/ap/ieee802_11.c
@@ -6474,7 +6474,8 @@
 		 * Auth/AssocReq so it can act on it.
 		 */
 		if (hapd->conf->external_rsn_auth && len > 25 &&
-		    mgmt->u.action.category == WLAN_ACTION_RADIO_MEASUREMENT)
+		    (mgmt->u.action.category == WLAN_ACTION_RADIO_MEASUREMENT ||
+		     mgmt->u.action.category == WLAN_ACTION_WNM))
 			ext_auth_notify_assocreq(hapd, mgmt->sa,
 					 (const u8 *) mgmt, len);
 #endif /* CONFIG_EXTERNAL_RSN_AUTH */
